A multi-line `declare namespace` is one outline line spanning its block; the exported function and const inside it aren't listed.
== args
input/ambient-namespace-nested.ts
== file input/ambient-namespace-nested.ts
declare namespace App {
  export function init(): void;
  export const config: any;
}
== stdout
input/ambient-namespace-nested.ts (4 lines)
[L1-L4] declare namespace App
